WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:35.000


2
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
<b>Arjuna is at the peak of his confused state,</b>

3
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.208
<b>and here, finally, he's giving </b>
<b>another example of his greatness.</b>

4
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.625
<b>Here, he bows his head</b>

5
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:49.041
<b>before the Supreme Lord, Sri Krishna,</b>

6
00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:50.458
<b>and says,</b>

7
00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:51.833
<b>"O Krishna,</b>

8
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.333
<b>O Gopal,</b>

9
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:56.375
<b>my mind seems weak to me,</b>

10
00:00:56.375 --> 00:01:01.708
<b>my situation regarding dharma and</b>
<b>duty is extremely conflicted.</b>

11
00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:05.833
<b>Please tell me definitively what is right.</b>

12
00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:08.166
<b>I bow my head at your feet,</b>

13
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.083
<b>I am merely your disciple.</b>

14
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.500
<b>Please instruct me."</b>

15
00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:17.375


16
00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:21.750
<b>This is one of the most important verses</b>
<b>of the Bhagavad Gita.</b>

17
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.000
<b>Here's why...</b>

18
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.125
<b>Until now, Arjuna was trying to untangle</b>
<b>the knot of his confusion himself.</b>

19
00:01:28.125 --> 00:01:30.125
<b>But as one knot would loosen,</b>

20
00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:32.666
<b>two more would form.</b>

21
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:37.875
<b>It's as if the spider of dilemma</b>
<b>had trapped him in its web</b>

22
00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:42.083
<b>the more he struggled,</b>
<b>the more entangled he became.</b>

23
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:42.916
<b>But</b>

24
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:47.125
<b>fortunately, near Arjuna is not just his</b>
<b>chariot's driver,</b>

25
00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:49.375
<b>but the driver of his life,</b>

26
00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.916
<b>Sri Krishna. </b>

27
00:01:50.916 --> 00:01:54.458
<b>Here, Arjuna takes such an important step</b>

28
00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:56.416
<b>that will not only help him,</b>

29
00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.125
<b>but</b>

30
00:01:57.125 --> 00:02:03.125
<b>will aid in the welfare of all mankind for eternity.</b>

31
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:04.708
<b>This will become the</b>
<b>foundation for such teachings</b>

32
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:10.750
<b>that will help humans overcome</b>
<b>their ignorance and dilemmas.</b>

33
00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:12.958
<b>Arjuna is setting a great example</b>

34
00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:15.791
<b>that no matter how much</b>
<b>knowledge one acquires,</b>

35
00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:18.541
<b>how much one argues and reasons,</b>

36
00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:21.416
<b>how much advice one takes from others,</b>

37
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:24.333
<b>there will come a time in life</b>

38
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:28.625
<b>when all this will fail to solve your problem.</b>

39
00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:29.708
<b>In such times,</b>

40
00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:31.541
<b>we must bow our heads</b>

41
00:02:31.541 --> 00:02:33.750
<b>before God himself,</b>

42
00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.916
<b>before the Supreme Lord Sri Krishna.</b>

43
00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:39.708
<b>Arjuna here is acknowledging his weakness</b>

44
00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:43.250
<b>and surrendering at the Lord's feet.</b>

45
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:46.250
<b>That "Now, you alone are my teacher,</b>

46
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:50.291
<b>and I am just a follower dependent on you,</b>

47
00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:52.625
<b>please guide my path."</b>

48
00:02:52.625 --> 00:02:55.500
<b>This self-surrender is necessary.</b>

49
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.250
<b>Until now, Arjuna was Krishna's companion,</b>

50
00:02:58.250 --> 00:02:59.375
<b>his friend;</b>

51
00:02:59.375 --> 00:03:04.041
<b>somewhere his inner 'I' was</b>
<b>repeatedly raising its head.</b>

52
00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:05.291
<b>But now here,</b>

53
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:06.416
<b>that 'I'</b>

54
00:03:06.416 --> 00:03:10.166
<b>is beginning to dissolve at his guru's feet.</b>

55
00:03:10.166 --> 00:03:13.833
<b>Sri Krishna had orchestrated</b>
<b>all this for this very moment.</b>

56
00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:14.541
<b>But</b>

57
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:18.916
<b>he will still test Arjuna's surrender a little more.</b>

58
00:03:18.916 --> 00:03:22.625
<b>He will let Arjuna speak for a while longer.</b>

59
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:27.500


60
00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.750
<b>Arjuna is calling himself weak here,</b>

61
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:31.625
<b>but</b>

62
00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:33.416
<b>the truth is</b>

63
00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:37.458
<b>that this is where his</b>
<b>greatest strength shines through.</b>

64
00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:41.416
<b>This surrender is not weakness at all;</b>

65
00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:48.125
<b>it's a sign of acknowledging that</b>
<b>your abilities have limits too.</b>

66
00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:54.833
<b>Only when you accept the limits of your</b>
<b>abilities can you expand those limits.</b>

67
00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:58.375
<b>To assume you have an</b>
<b>answer for every question,</b>

68
00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:05.000
<b>To believe you need no one,</b>
<b>that you have enough strength on your own,</b>

69
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:09.458
<b>All this is a reflection of ego, of arrogance.</b>

70
00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:10.500
<b>But</b>

71
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.500
<b> to bow your head at the right time and say</b>

72
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.833
<b>that perhaps you don't have</b>
<b>the answer to this question,</b>

73
00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:17.541
<b>or that</b>

74
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:21.333
<b>you need guidance</b>

75
00:04:21.333 --> 00:04:23.833
<b>this is not only a sign of humility</b>

76
00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:24.625
<b>but also</b>

77
00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:27.166
<b>a courageous step.</b>

78
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.958
<b>One who remains humble,</b>

79
00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:34.250
<b>who's ready to learn new lessons</b>
<b>by surrendering at the right time,</b>

80
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.750
<b>will win life's battles.</b>

81
00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:44.958
<b>The tree that bends in a storm</b>
<b>is never broken by it.</b>

82
00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:47.291
<b>But</b>

83
00:04:47.291 --> 00:04:53.708
<b>don't mistake surrender here for blind faith.</b>

84
00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:57.250
<b>Blind faith doesn't question, </b>

85
00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.458
<b>doesn't probe its own judgment,</b>

86
00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:04.458
<b>understands the literal meaning of words</b>

87
00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:07.666
<b>but doesn't see their essence.</b>

88
00:05:07.666 --> 00:05:09.000
<b>Surrender</b>

89
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.916
<b>is humble indeed,</b>

90
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:12.958
<b>but not blind.</b>

91
00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:15.750
<b>Surrender listens with an open heart,</b>

92
00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.708
<b> understands,</b>

93
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:18.916
<b>asks questions,</b>

94
00:05:18.916 --> 00:05:26.083
<b>and accepts every answer</b>
<b>with full responsibility.</b>

95
00:05:26.083 --> 00:05:29.958
<b>Arjuna's questions haven't stopped yet.</b>

96
00:05:29.958 --> 00:05:33.958
<b>He has surrendered before me,</b>

97
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:37.041
<b>but he will ask more questions,</b>

98
00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:39.000
<b>seek their answers,</b>

99
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:43.541
<b>and accept each answer with</b>
<b>his own responsibility.</b>

100
00:05:43.541 --> 00:05:45.541
<b>Responsibility.</b>

101
00:05:45.541 --> 00:05:48.958
<b>After surrender, the path you see,</b>

102
00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:51.208
<b>the steps you take</b>

103
00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:54.791
<b>you don't shake off your responsibility by saying, </b>

104
00:05:54.791 --> 00:05:56.000
<b>"I was told,</b>

105
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.166
<b>so I did it."</b>

106
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:00.375
<b>You take full responsibility,</b>

107
00:06:00.375 --> 00:06:02.458
<b>that I understood with an open heart,</b>

108
00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:03.833
<b>it felt right to me,</b>

109
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:06.958
<b>and this is now entirely my step.</b>

110
00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:08.708
<b>And this is the difference between</b>

111
00:06:08.708 --> 00:06:10.500
<b> blind faith</b>

112
00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.041
<b>and surrender.</b>

113
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:17.833


114
00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:19.166
<b>Sometimes,</b>

115
00:06:19.166 --> 00:06:22.833
<b>expressing the need for</b>
<b>guidance seems difficult.</b>

116
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:25.666
<b>This especially happens</b>

117
00:06:25.666 --> 00:06:27.500
<b>when you're facing </b>

118
00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.750
<b>a friend </b>

119
00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.125
<b>or someone close.</b>

120
00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:33.250
<b>Thoughts might arise like,</b>

121
00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.791
<b>"How can they know more than me?</b>

122
00:06:36.791 --> 00:06:39.333
<b>They're my age</b>

123
00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:41.375
<b>or younger,"</b>

124
00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:42.583
<b>or</b>

125
00:06:42.583 --> 00:06:45.750
<b>"I wonder what they'll think of me,</b>

126
00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.500
<b>it might be wrong to open up to them."</b>

127
00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:50.416
<b>These are all signs of</b>

128
00:06:50.416 --> 00:06:53.916
<b>an invisible barrier hidden within you,</b>

129
00:06:53.916 --> 00:06:57.041
<b>keeping you from progress,</b>

130
00:06:57.041 --> 00:07:01.541
<b>blocking your path to growth.</b>

131
00:07:01.541 --> 00:07:02.708
<b>Because</b>

132
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:05.291
<b>if you're in a problem</b>

133
00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:07.708
<b>and truly </b>

134
00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:10.291
<b>need advice from someone,</b>

135
00:07:10.291 --> 00:07:14.791
<b>then solving your problem is paramount.</b>

136
00:07:14.791 --> 00:07:18.583
<b>How does it matter what their age is,</b>

137
00:07:18.583 --> 00:07:20.875
<b>or whether they might misunderstand?</b>

138
00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:23.791
<b>The goal is the solution, isn't it?</b>

139
00:07:23.791 --> 00:07:26.750
<b>It's essential to keep this clear.</b>

140
00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.750
<b>Arjuna is my friend,</b>

141
00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:29.958
<b>my relative too,</b>

142
00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:32.875
<b>and there isn't much difference in our age.</b>

143
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:35.041
<b>But</b>

144
00:07:35.041 --> 00:07:38.125
<b>here, he's overlooking all these things</b>

145
00:07:38.125 --> 00:07:41.125
<b>and seeing only a guru in me,</b>

146
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:43.958
<b>surrendering.</b>

147
00:07:43.958 --> 00:07:44.958
<b>Because</b>

148
00:07:44.958 --> 00:07:50.041
<b>only in this state will all the</b>
<b>barriers in his mind be removed,</b>

149
00:07:50.041 --> 00:07:54.791
<b>he'll be able to receive my words</b>
<b>with an open mind.</b>

150
00:07:54.791 --> 00:07:57.125
<b>And guru?</b>

151
00:07:57.125 --> 00:08:01.000
<b>What's the true meaning of this word 'guru'?</b>

152
00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:05.375
<b>A guru is one who shows us the right path</b>
<b>in times of doubt.</b>

153
00:08:05.375 --> 00:08:09.791
<b>A guru is one who makes us aware of</b>
<b>our own hidden abilities.</b>

154
00:08:09.791 --> 00:08:14.291
<b>A guru isn't someone who fights a battle</b>
<b>for us to make us win;</b>

155
00:08:14.291 --> 00:08:15.916
<b>a guru is one</b>

156
00:08:15.916 --> 00:08:18.125
<b>who instills in us the confidence</b>

157
00:08:18.125 --> 00:08:24.791
<b>that we are capable of winning any</b>
<b>battle on our own strength.</b>

158
00:08:24.791 --> 00:08:28.208
<b>Arjuna fought the battle, didn't he?</b>

159
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:29.500
<b>Not me.</b>

160
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:35.333
<b>I only awakened in him the confidence</b>
<b>to walk on the right path.</b>

161
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:36.458
<b>In society,</b>

162
00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:40.125
<b>in family, anyone can be your guru.</b>

163
00:08:40.125 --> 00:08:43.208
<b>Whoever you learn from is a guru.</b>

164
00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:44.500
<b>Stay humble,</b>

165
00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.583
<b>keep learning.</b>

166
00:08:47.125 --> 00:08:51.333


167
00:08:51.333 --> 00:08:55.125
<b>There's immense power in humility.</b>

168
00:08:55.125 --> 00:08:58.333
<b>Never hesitate to say</b>

169
00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:01.583
<b>that you don't know the answer to a question.</b>

170
00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:08.125
<b>It's better to acknowledge and then learn,</b>
<b>rather than give a wrong answer.</b>

171
00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:10.666
<b>First, admit that you don't know the answer,</b>

172
00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:13.333
<b>and then try to find out</b>

173
00:09:13.333 --> 00:09:15.250
<b>what the correct answer is.</b>

174
00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.958
<b>How does one progress in professional life?</b>

175
00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:21.500
<b>When you learn new tasks</b>

176
00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.083
<b>and gain new abilities.</b>

177
00:09:24.083 --> 00:09:29.750
<b>Continuous learning is the biggest necessity</b>
<b>for progress in professional life.</b>

178
00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:30.875
<b>But</b>

179
00:09:30.875 --> 00:09:40.291
<b>it's necessary to first humbly accept that</b>
<b>you're willing to learn.</b>

180
00:09:40.291 --> 00:09:42.791
<b>"I know everything"</b>

181
00:09:42.791 --> 00:09:46.541
<b>constantly trying to show this</b>
<b> is hollow arrogance,</b>

182
00:09:46.541 --> 00:09:48.291
<b>a mistake</b>

183
00:09:48.291 --> 00:09:51.583
<b>that will hinder success.</b>

184
00:09:51.583 --> 00:09:57.208
<b>People who do this create a cage of</b>
<b>pride around themselves,</b>

185
00:09:57.208 --> 00:09:59.791
<b>and progress is outside this cage.</b>

186
00:09:59.791 --> 00:10:02.708
<b>Those eager to learn keep moving forward,</b>

187
00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:07.500
<b>while those trapped in this cage</b>
<b> just keep watching.</b>

188
00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.875
<b>Why are you stuck, my friend?</b>

189
00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:13.666
<b>Open the door of this cage</b>
<b>with the key of humility,</b>

190
00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:14.500
<b>come out,</b>

191
00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.458
<b>learn,</b>

192
00:10:15.458 --> 00:10:16.250
<b> move forward </b>

193
00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.375
<b>towards success.</b>

